# DO wine.cnc-ddraw
#
# cnc-ddraw, for a game that draws with DirectDraw, keeping the aspect
# ratio. windowed=true is what lets native fullscreen adopt the window, but
# it also makes cnc-ddraw swallow the first click; the wrapp's cursor-lock
# helper works around that. See docs/wine-in-process-helpers.md before
# changing these settings. Each must already be in cnc-ddraw's ddraw.ini
# (--must-exist): one that's gone means another cnc-ddraw, whose settings
# would leave the game wrongly windowed.
FUNCTION cnc-ddraw
  WINE.WINETRICKS --progress=graphics cnc_ddraw
  EDIT C:/windows/syswow64/ddraw.ini --must-exist --ini=ddraw.maintas=true --ini=ddraw.windowed=true
END
